---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHead from '../components/PageHead.astro';
---
<Base title="In the News" description="Toteally Sisters and the Ovarian Cancer Research Alliance in the news.">
  <PageHead
    title="In the news"
    lede="We’re proud to be part of the conversation around ovarian and gynecologic cancers, and prouder when it reaches more people."
  />
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap story">
      <article class="prose">
        <p class="source">WESH 2 · Ovarian Cancer Awareness Month</p>
        <h2>Raising awareness, all September long</h2>
        <p>WESH 2 highlighted the work of the Ovarian Cancer Research Alliance (OCRA) in raising awareness and promoting events throughout September. With nearly 20,000 women expected to be diagnosed with ovarian cancer this year, early detection remains critical, yet only 17% of cases are caught in Stage 1.</p>
        <p>OCRA’s efforts include community education, symptom awareness (using the acronym BEACH) and fitness-based fundraisers like Ovarian Cycle Orlando. Toteally Sisters proudly supports these initiatives and takes part in local events all month long.</p>
        <p><a class="link-arrow" href="https://www.wesh.com/article/ovarian-cancer-awareness/44975144" rel="noopener">Read the article on WESH.com <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></p>
      </article>
      <figure class="video">
        <video controls preload="none" poster="/media/wesh-poster.jpg" width="960" height="540">
          <source src="/media/wesh-ovarian-awareness.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
          Your browser can’t play this video. <a href="https://www.wesh.com/article/ovarian-cancer-awareness/44975144">Watch it on WESH.com</a>.
        </video>
        <figcaption>The WESH 2 segment on Ovarian Cancer Awareness Month (4:44). The article on WESH.com covers the same story in text.</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .story { display: grid; gap: 3rem; align-items: start; }
  .source { font-weight: 700; color: var(--teal-ink); }
  .video video { width: 100%; height: auto; background: var(--night); box-shadow: var(--shadow-card); border: 10px solid var(--paper); }
  figcaption { margin-top: 1rem; font-size: var(--step--1); color: var(--ink-soft); max-width: 44ch; }
  @media (min-width: 1000px) { .story { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 4rem; } }
</style>
